# Copy to /etc/pet-ingress/dnspod.env ON THE SERVER (root:root, chmod 600). Never commit the real file,
# never paste the token into chat. Used by acme.sh (dns_dp) and by pet-ddns.py.
# Create the token in the DNSPod console: 用户中心 -> 密钥管理 -> DNSPod Token -> 创建密钥
# (the ID is a number, the Token a hex string). Scope it to the birdshao.cn domain if the console allows.
DP_Id=
DP_Key=
